{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1mJCUih2evk2c2SpkFZ", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I signed off after filing one bug, which the developer confirmed. My confidence is moderate (0.6), because I didn't open every preference screen.\n\n**Bug filed: card browser subtitle disappears after rotating.** With the Spanish deck selected, the toolbar showed \"4 cards shown\". After rotating the device (and back), it showed only \"Spanish\" even though the 4 cards were still listed. This matches the \"subtitle updated only when a search finishes\" change. My first report used a Settings round trip as the repro and the developer couldn't reproduce it. The rotation steps were confirmed.\n\n**Checked and working:**\n- **Searching:**\n  - `tag:verb` returned only \"comer\", with \"1 card shown\".\n  - `deck:French` returned the 3 French cards.\n  - A no-match search showed \"No cards found in deck 'Spanish'\".\n  - Choosing All decks showed all 7 cards.\n- **Theme:** switching to Night applied immediately to the open Appearance screen, and Day restored it.\n- **Timebox:** the on/off switch, the − button and a typed value (30) all stayed after leaving and reopening the screen.\n- **Study screen:** two new cards both showed Again <1m, Hard <6m, Good <10m, Easy 5d. After I answered Easy on \"mesa\", the browser showed it due 2026-11-18, which is 5 days out, so the button label matched.\n- **Keep screen on:** the toggle changed and I switched it back off.\n\n**Gaps:**\n- I didn't open General, Sync, Notifications, Controls, Accessibility or Backups.\n- The timebox field showed 21 once after I typed \"1\" and then tapped −. I couldn't reproduce it cleanly, so I didn't report it.\n- I changed some data while testing: three cards were answered (comer, mesa and hola), so their states changed. I also left the timebox at 30 mins instead of \"Disabled\"."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 692, "cache_read_input_tokens": 54955, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 692}, "output_tokens": 632, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "94d365fd-9ca2-4688-8c50-562416043223", "uuid": "9ebe86d9-6b5a-42e9-98b8-a63eef5d0a2f", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T23:05:19.480Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch1mJCG5avTjACQt8NP8e"}
